ApproveToken_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not authorized
│  └── it should revert with Unauthorized
└── when caller authorized
   ├── given approval registry unset
   │  └── it should revert with ApprovalRegistryUnset
   └── given approval registry set
      ├── when spender not allowlisted (cap zero)
      │  └── it should revert with SpenderNotAllowed
      └── when spender allowlisted
         ├── when amount exceeds cap
         │  └── it should revert with AmountExceedsCap
         ├── when amount equals cap
         │  ├── it should set allowance to cap
         │  └── it should emit Approval
         ├── when amount below cap
         │  └── it should set allowance to amount
         └── when amount zero
            ├── given prior allowance
            │  └── it should clear the allowance
            └── given no prior allowance
               └── it should be a no-op
